# 4. ImagePullPolicy

| Policy         | Meaning                                    |
| -------------- | ------------------------------------------ |
| `Always`       | Every container start par image pull/check |
| `IfNotPresent` | Local image available ho to use karega     |
| `Never`        | Sirf local image use karega                |

Example:

```yaml
imagePullPolicy: IfNotPresent
```

