# 5. Pod Scheduling

## Pod Affinity

Pods ko **same/nearby location** par place karne ke liye.

```text
Pod A
  +
Pod B
  ↓
Same Node / Topology
```

## Pod Anti-Affinity

Pods ko different nodes par spread karne ke liye.

```text
Node-1 → Pod A
Node-2 → Pod B
Node-3 → Pod C
```

Purpose: **High Availability**

## Node Affinity

Pod ko specific type ke node par schedule karna.

Example:

```text
GPU Pod
 ↓
GPU Node
```

