# 10. Professional Troubleshooting Approach

Production mein har baar worker node ka SSH access available nahi hota.

Isliye `kubectl` based troubleshooting strong honi chahiye:

```text
Problem
 ↓
kubectl get
 ↓
kubectl describe
 ↓
kubectl logs
 ↓
Events
 ↓
Service / Endpoints
 ↓
DNS / Network
 ↓
IAM / Permissions
 ↓
Application
```

Agar issue Networking/DB team ke scope mein ho:

```text
Specific Error
+
Logs
+
Required Fix
```

team ko provide karo.

