# 11. AI in DevOps

AI ko **replacement nahi, productivity tool** ki tarah use karo.

Use AI for:

* Log analysis
* Error explanation
* Command suggestions
* YAML generation
* Troubleshooting ideas

But:

> **AI-generated commands ko documentation aur environment ke according validate karo.**

Best professional answer:

> **"I don't know right now, but I can investigate and find the root cause."**

